<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bnk sets warrants on Wheelock.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bnk sets warrants on Wheelock.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Tuesday it had launched 100 million American style warrants on shares of Wheelock &amp; Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$19.465	PREMIUM	   13.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.6504	GEARING	   3.52x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  22.APR.98	MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$22.90	 PAY DATE	  24.FEB.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
